<title>UK: Reuters 6th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 6th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK to Asia/Australasia/Middle East GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   April 18	     April 04</p>
<p>			  NORTH ASIA</p>
<p> LON-HKG	 1.18		   1.18</p>
<p> LON-NRT	 1.90		   1.95</p>
<p> LON-PEK	 1.50		   1.45</p>
<p> LON-SEL	 1.68		   1.87</p>
<p> LON-SHA	 1.50		   N.A.</p>
<p> LON-TPE	 1.24		   1.25</p>
<p>	     SOUTH-EAST ASIA/AUSTRALASIA</p>
<p> LON-BKK	 1.12		   1.13</p>
<p> LON-JAK	 1.08		   1.10</p>
<p> LON-KUL	 1.00		   N.A.</p>
<p> LON-MNL	 1.40		   1.42</p>
<p> LON-SIN	 1.15		   1.19</p>
<p> LON-SYD	 1.95		   2.00</p>
<p>			MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> LON-BAH	 0.85		   0.93</p>
<p> LON-DXB	 0.73		   0.80</p>
<p> LON-TLV	 1.05		   N.A.</p>
<p>		 INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p> LON-BOM	 0.76		   0.73</p>
<p> LON-DEL	 0.74		   0.70</p>
<p> LON-KHI	 1.08		   1.09</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
